    <string name="privacy_contact">Contact developer</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">ScanCode decodes camera frames and photos on your device without saving the images. Camera permission is optional.\n\nHistory keeps up to 200 saved codes. Collections keep their codes independently of the history limit. Both stay in private app storage and are excluded from Android backup and device transfer. Link reviews run on the device.\n\nOpening, looking up, copying or sharing a code passes its data to the feature or app you selected. Google ML Kit may send device and app metadata, a per-installation identifier, and diagnostic and usage information to Google over an encrypted connection.</string>
